---
import Layout from "@/components/Layout.astro";
import { publicProfile } from "@/data/profile";
---

<Layout
  title={`關於我 | ${publicProfile.brandName}`}
  description={`${publicProfile.brandName}由 ${publicProfile.ownerDisplayName} 提供品牌視覺、印刷、網站與數位內容相關服務。`}
  mainClass="about-concept-shell"
>
  <div class="about-concept-page">
    <section class="about-concept reveal" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <header class="about-concept__header">
        <h1 id="about-title">理念</h1>
        <p>企業理念</p>
      </header>

      <div class="about-concept__statement">
        <p>不只是完成畫面，<br />而是為了能被使用的結果。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-concept__body" aria-label="工作理念">
        <p>
          我相信設計的目的，不只是把內容做得好看，而是讓企業想傳達的訊息，被清楚理解、順利製作，並且能延伸到不同媒介中持續使用。
        </p>
        <p>
          因此，T2 以個人工作室的方式，由我直接參與需求整理、視覺設計、印刷輸出、WordPress 網站與數位內容支援。從一張活動視覺、一份印刷物，到網站與社群素材，我會先確認使用情境、製作條件與後續延伸，再安排適合的執行方式。
        </p>
        <p>
          我重視的是清楚的溝通、穩定的製作品質，以及能被企業實際使用的成果。無論是單次專案，或月度／半遠端合作，都希望讓每一次設計輸出，成為品牌日常累積的一部分。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(.about-concept-shell) {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100vw;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .about-concept-page {
    width: 100vw;
    max-width: 100vw;
    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
    margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw);
    overflow-x: hidden;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--home-ink);
  }

  .about-concept-page :global(.reveal) {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    animation: none;
  }

  .about-concept {
    position: relative;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: min(920px, calc(100vw - var(--home-safe) * 2));
    max-width: 100%;
    min-height: min(820px, calc(100vh - 96px));
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(58px, 8vw, 104px) clamp(76px, 10vw, 132px);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-concept::before,
  .about-concept::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--home-yellow);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .about-concept::before {
    left: clamp(0px, 2vw, 20px);
    top: clamp(42px, 7vw, 78px);
    width: clamp(18px, 1.9vw, 27px);
    height: clamp(18px, 1.9vw, 27px);
    opacity: 0.52;
  }

  .about-concept::after {
    right: clamp(8px, 7vw, 92px);
    top: clamp(270px, 33vw, 360px);
    width: clamp(14px, 1.45vw, 20px);
    height: clamp(14px, 1.45vw, 20px);
    opacity: 0.68;
  }

  .about-concept__header {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .about-concept__header h1,
  .about-concept__header p,
  .about-concept__statement p,
  .about-concept__body p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Noto Serif TC", "Yu Mincho", "Hiragino Mincho ProN", "Songti TC", "PMingLiU", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .about-concept__header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.4vw, 3.15rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }

  .about-concept__header p {
    font-size: clamp(0.82rem, 1.05vw, 1rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 0.36em;
  }

  .about-concept__statement {
    margin-top: clamp(62px, 8vw, 92px);
  }

  .about-concept__statement p {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.45vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1.85;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  }

  .about-concept__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(24px, 3.2vw, 34px);
    width: min(650px, 100%);
    margin-top: clamp(54px, 7vw, 82px);
  }

  .about-concept__body p {
    color: #1f2b38;
    font-size: clamp(0.92rem, 1.08vw, 1.04rem);
    line-height: 2.22;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about-concept {
      width: min(100vw - 40px, 920px);
      min-height: auto;
      padding-block: 52px 84px;
    }

    .about-concept::before {
      left: 4px;
      top: 34px;
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
    }

    .about-concept::after {
      right: 10px;
      top: 300px;
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
    }

    .about-concept__header h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 9vw, 2.5rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    .about-concept__header p {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    }

    .about-concept__statement {
      margin-top: 54px;
    }

    .about-concept__statement p {
      font-size: clamp(1.22rem, 6vw, 1.65rem);
      line-height: 1.9;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .about-concept__body {
      margin-top: 46px;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .about-concept__body p {
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      line-height: 2.05;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
  }
</style>
